    "Keep every existing preceding guard and exact24case roster. If spinner/snack insertion returns null, reject. Then apply ordinary aggregate composer to its expected CSS only; compare complete untouched actual CSS.",
    "Add exact dependency pins for JS composer/frozen ordinary rootmodel and Python composer/ordinaryport. The parent source/tool owner remains separately responsible for shared transitive pins.",
